  "findings": [
    "Resolution exists only outside the envelope: fixed 0.820 at 2x physics, 1.000 at 50 ms; no-DR 0.334 and 0.016.",
    "lucid_rg == fixed within one-seed noise on every cell (AUC[1,2] 0.911 vs 0.925), as H1a predicts.",
    "The controller collapse cost lucid_s4_rg real capability: h6000 vs final 0.832 vs 0.732 at 1.5x, 0.643 vs 0.518 at 2x, 0.992 vs 0.918 at 50 ms.",
    "But the intact mixture (h6000, lambda~0.99, strata at 0.25/0.5/0.75/1.0) is STILL well below fixed at the frontier (0.832 vs 0.924, 0.643 vs 0.820; AUC[1,2] 0.817 vs 0.925) with no nominal dividend (in-envelope AUC 0.992 vs 0.999, both at ceiling). Three quarters of its environments train below the envelope edge; on this task that is less exposure to the hard end, not retention. The stage-5 'widest mixture retains best' result does not transfer from fine-tuning to from-scratch."
  ],
